  "description": "Pure C# implementation of Bento4, the MP4 / ISO-BMFF library: read, write, inspect, fragment, mux and encrypt/decrypt (CENC, CBCS, PIFF, OMA DCF, Marlin, ISMA) MP4 files, with AVC/HEVC/AAC/AC-3/E-AC-3/AC-4 parsers and MPEG-2 TS output. No native dependencies; targets .NET Framework 2.0 (and so 3.5 and 4.x), .NET Standard 1.3 / 2.0 and .NET 6. Verified byte for byte against the original Bento4 tools.",
  "id": "Bento4Sharp",
